Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.86,0:02:08.98,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Com as expectativas crescendo, estou super empolgada
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.11,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k54}{\be2\fad(150,150)}pyon {\k50}to {\k37}ta{\k18}t{\k35}te{\k21}ta {\k44}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:12.11,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}De pé, bem certinha
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:14.63,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k24}{\k34}{\be2\fad(150,150)}zu{\k19}t{\k51}to {\k37}ma{\k14}t{\k39}te{\k16}ta {\k18}no
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:14.63,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quanto tempo eu tive que esperar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:18.82,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k9}{\k41}{\be2\fad(150,150)}su{\k17}re{\k18}chi{\k18}ga{\k8}u {\k24}so{\k73}no {\k16}e{\k52}gao {\k16}da{\k12}ki{\k25}shi{\k21}me{\k69}tai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:18.82,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quando eu te vejo passando bem ao meu lado, eu quero te abraçar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:19.95,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k9}{\k42}{\be2\fad(150,150)}gyu{\k20}t{\k42}to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:19.95,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Bem apertado
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.91,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k38}{\be2\fad(150,150)}oi{\k19}de {\kf74}sunny {\kf145}love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:25.91,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Vem cá, meu amor ensolarado
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.62,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k13}{\k32}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ha{\k18}ji{\k37}ma{\k37}ri {\k151}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.91,0:02:28.62,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quando é hora de nos encontrar,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:33.65,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k36}i{\k32}tsu{\k34}de{\k36}mo {\k20}kyu{\k33}u {\k89}ni {\k25}ha{\k44}shi{\k17}ri{\k38}da{\k81}su
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:33.65,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Você aparece de repente, correndo direto pra mim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.80,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k26}{\k17}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ma{\k9}ru {\k23}de {\k33}don{\k19}na {\k38}par{\k34}ty {\k116}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.80,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quase como se cada festa estivesse acontecendo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.67,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k44}{\k26}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ka{\k27}su{\k30}mu {\k41}you {\k119}na
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.67,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Num brilho radiante
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:41.95,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k40}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ki{\k15}ra{\k16}me{\k32}ku {\k21}ba{\k19}sho {\k67}de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:41.95,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Esse lugar tá tão iluminado
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:47.26,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k3}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ko{\k19}ko {\k49}wo {\k23}ta{\k28}shi{\k21}ka{\k31}me{\k72}te{\k72}i{\k195}te
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:47.26,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Dá uma olhada onde a gente está
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:02:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Achou o seu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.91,Top,,0,0,0,,Não é a turma C...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.08,Top,,0,0,0,,Estou na turma A.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.38,Top,,0,0,0,,Também tô na turma A!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.29,Top,,0,0,0,,Estou na turma B.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:10.70,Top,,0,0,0,,Não acredito!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:11.98,Top,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:15.94,Top,,0,0,0,,Nunca fiquei em turma diferente de você!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:17.51,Top,,0,0,0,,Ei, tá tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:21.22,Top,,0,0,0,,Estamos em turmas diferentes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:26.38,Top,,0,0,0,,Tô em turma diferente da Tamako de novo...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:30.10,Top,,0,0,0,,Estamos na mesma turma que a Asagiri-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Você quer dizer a do clube de badminton?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que ela não gosta da gente...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.74,0:03:46.70,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(639,282)}Episódio
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.74,0:03:46.70,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(639,282)}Episódio
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.74,0:03:46.70,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(640,482)}Apaixonado por uma Garota Fria
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.74,0:03:46.70,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(640,482)}Apaixonado por uma Garota Fria
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Apaixonado por uma garota fria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou o professor da turma de vocês, Sr. Yagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Me casei mês passado, então tô todo animado!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Parabéns!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos entrar no espírito do novo período e nos empolgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos começar com as apresentações.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Asagiri-san, comece. {pretty sure he says から here}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu nome é Asagiri Shiori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Faço parte do clube de badminton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-los.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, Inoue-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, Kitashirakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou Kitajirakawa—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitashirakawa Tamako.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha família administra uma loja de mochi chamada Tamaya no distrito comercial Bunny Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora nossos sakuramochi estão uma delícia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Venham provar quando puderem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito prazer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu faço parte do clube de bastão!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou Makino Kanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou boa em medir de olho e adoro ângulos retos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Me interesso por vigas de madeira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero consertar o armário atrás de mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:54.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs40\fnMarker SD\c&H474949&\frz359\pos(804.572,344.286)\b0}Fora de ordem {\b1}{locker}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Faço parte do clube de bastão.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Como é sua nova turma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooji está lá comigo.{Mochizou!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,E a sua?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nosso professor tá bem empolgado. \NParece que vai ser uma turma divertida.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar ainda melhor quando esse armário for consertado.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Que diabos é aquilo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutucar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,O armário atrás de mim está quebrado, e eu quero consertá-lo...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu venha bem cedo amanhã pra fazer isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Para com isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que dá pra pregar um prego com um bastão?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, batons não servem pra isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Este aqui. Este filme.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece bom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.07,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você tá fazendo aqui, pássaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, você?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse pássaro pode servir de projetor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Só que ele não sabe disso.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera, de que diabos você tá falando?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Moça, você tá sozinha?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Moça, você gosta de pássaros?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu corpo está...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,tão pesado...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.13,0:06:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Deveria estar procurando a noiva do meu príncipe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que é mesmo certo eu estar—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela sumiu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela sumiu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde eu estou?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Calma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Só preciso voar pra cima pra ter uma visão melhor—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou caindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,O pássaro de hoje de manhã...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.01,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Destino.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Como você está falando?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é um pássaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Perdoe-me, moça.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Você {\i1}é{\i0} um pássaro, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu nome é Dera Mochiyucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual é o seu nome, moça?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori.
