Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori-san, que tal uma xícara de chá na minha humilde morada como agradecimento?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, devo ir agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas lá tem sakuramochi delicioso!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuramochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Na verdade é uma morada temporária, não minha casa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma loja de mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma loja de mochi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Seja bem-vinda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? Eu pensei que fosse a Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta é Asagiri Shiori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Você estuda na mesma escola que a Tama-chan, certo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta é a Shiori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Aceite, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.37,0:07:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é o pássaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A garotinha anda me chamando de "Dera-chan" ultimamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Que legal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? Você é amiga da Tama-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... hum...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere um segundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,É bom, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Asagiri-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Me perdi na cidade,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,e essa jovem generosa e bonita me trouxe de volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Não fique aí! Convide-a para entrar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Devo ir agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Espere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Experimente um pouco do nosso sakuramochi primeiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.28,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fs50\fnComplete in Him\c&H2C2D2B&\b1\pos(640.457,433.2)}Cadeira do Dera{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.28,0:08:36.28,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs30\fnComplete in Him\c&H333333&\b0\pos(665.6,492.628)}Não jogue fora!!{\b1}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Aqui está!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai em frente!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,É bom, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:08:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Que alívio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fico muito feliz que você tenha vindo nos visitar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Até cheira a flores de cerejeira na nossa casa—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda de volta!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma amiga da escola?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Asa—{overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{Dera}Asagiri Shiori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.75,0:09:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Devo ir agora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não fica para o jantar, já que está aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é do seu namorado?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,É da minha mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é sua mãe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu algo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela disse que vai voltar tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Então você devia ficar para o jantar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Com licença!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, com licença um segundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cadê o papai?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Reunião do distrito!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer pudim também?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fnBrushcut\fs150\pos(202,230)\c&H968C82&}ma
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fnBrushcut\fs150\c&H968C82&\pos(604.667,230)}ya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama-chan, o que vamos fazer no jantar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Peixe grelhado e croquetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,De novo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer que eu faça?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Você consegue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que consigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Carbonara com sopa de legumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,É tão chique! Quase não quero comer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece muito bom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe te fazer isso mesmo sendo nossa convidada...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu a ajudei a preparar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa carbonara está deliciosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa comer se não quiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem é agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,É do meu pai. Ele disse que o banho está quebrado...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu cabelo está tão bonito, Shiori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Que shampoo você usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shampoo!{added}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua pele também é muito macia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei que talvez você precisasse de ajuda, então...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Você poderia ficar, sabia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Não...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Asagiri-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,O jantar estava delicioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi nada...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vamos, Shiori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada por me receber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Até amanhã.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenha uma boa volta pra casa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A brisa da noite ainda está fria.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está com frio, Shiori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:42.18,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\blur1\fnCorbel\pos(568.111,57.556)}North Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode parar por aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi. Tenha uma boa volta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, não. Não precisa me agradecer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.56,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Shiori}Meu trem chegou. Tchau.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas seria um prazer passear pelas ruas ladeadas por cerejeiras com você novamente,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori-san—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:55.98,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\blur1\fnCorbel\pos(568.111,57.556)}North Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que vou pra casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:12:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{Eyecatch}
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.40,0:12:00.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(481,0)\c&H000000&\pos(1036,211)}Tamako Market
